answer (apologies if one was posted) ... under meta-yocto-bsp, in
linux-yocto_5.2.bbappend:

COMPATIBLE_MACHINE_genericx86 = "genericx86"
COMPATIBLE_MACHINE_genericx86-64 = "genericx86-64"
